  "notes": [
    "Same keys as the one-bar starter. Holding Alt reaches the bottom-left bar, so the same finger positions carry twice the spells.",
    "Alt is easier to hold than Shift for small hands, and Shift-number keys page the action bar by default in WoW.",
    "Turn on the bottom-left bar in Options > Action Bars to see what you put there."
